---
title: "Quiz Game - Home"
layout: layout.njk
---
<div class="hero">
    <h2>🎯 Welcome to the Ultimate Quiz Game!</h2>
    <p>Test your knowledge across various topics with our interactive quiz platform.</p>
</div>

<div class="features">
    <h3>✨ Features</h3>
    <ul>
        <li>Multiple quiz categories</li>
        <li>Responsive design</li>
        <li>Modern web technologies</li>
        <li>Fast static site generation</li>
    </ul>
</div>

<div class="recent-questions">
    <h3>📚 Recent Questions</h3>
    <div class="questions-grid">
        {% for question in collections.questions %}
        <div class="question-item">
            <a href="{{ question.url }}">{{ question.data.title }}</a>
        </div>
        {% endfor %}
    </div>
</div>

<div class="actions">
    <a href="/questions/" class="btn">View All Questions</a>
    <a href="/about/" class="btn">Learn More</a>
</div>